OL,3,AAfrica's richest man launches
OL,4,Acontinent's biggest share sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt now supplies more than 70% of
OL,7,FNigeria's energy consumption, and many
OL,8,FNigerians have expressed excitement at
OL,9,Fthe prospect of owning a part of it.
